cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this work, please cite it as below.
title: "The first missed move at factor 400 in the 547/727 prime race"
abstract: "Assuming the eight odd primitive Dirichlet factors have no zero in an explicit bounded region, which Dirichlet GRH implies, the first 400H miss in the dyadic 547/727 prime-ideal race is a gain, at a starting height located to within a factor of 1.0131. Unconditionally, failure of this localization forces a zero in that region."
